WEBVTT

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.900
Did you just say the 
Etzat Market is under attack?!

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.760
Yes, sir.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.720
The other four slave 
markets, as well.

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.490
The attackers seem 
to be quite skilled.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:23.870
After they made their way in, 
the market has requested reinforcements.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.880
Send additional men!

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.130
I refuse to let this 
cost me even more!

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.590
Something must be done!

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.320
Sir.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.770
Of all the wretched...!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.320
Most impressive, Sir Goemon!

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.030
Then perhaps I'll cut loose, as well!

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:50.700
Rock Fang!

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.230
<b>Rock Fang</b>

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.230
<b>Rock Fang</b>

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:07.870
Sir Goemon, I believe your 
ninjutsu and my magic

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:10.280
have a boosted, cumulative effect!

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.220
Unexpected.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.140
There don't appear to be 
any guards at the rear.

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.340
They've all gone straight 
for Arc and Goemon.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.340
Let's hurry!

00:02:58.730 --> 00:02:59.420
Come!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.450
Should I blow it away with magic?

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.420
No, it's all right.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.740
Wow, that's really impressive.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:23.880
Let's go.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.440
We've got intruders coming 
in through the front!

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.960
The royal army will be 
coming from the castle soon!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.750
Hold strong until then!

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.490
Lady Ponta?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.040
You people...

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:49.880
More intruders?!

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.820
Body to water, Liquid Wolf Fang!

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:07.400
So that's ninjutsu.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.820
Nicely done, Chiyome.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:09.810
There they are!

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.420
That's them!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:16.060
Blazing embers, heed my call. 
Consume all to ash!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.730
You're quite impressive 
yourself, Lady Ariane!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.520
Come on!

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:43.760
Wh-Who are you folks?

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.460
I am Chiyome of the Jinshin Clan!

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:50.900
We've come to rescue you all.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:54.710
Once we let you out, 
please follow our instructions.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:55.980
The Jinshin Clan?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.140
Did she say the Jinshin Clan?!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.400
Really?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.600
They're here to save us?

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.660
This is great!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.040
Please, get us out of here!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.790
Yes!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.780
Please, split up and free the others.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:11.920
If you can fight, take weapons 
from the fallen soldiers!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.250
There they are!

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.250
Don't let the intruders or the slaves escape!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.200
If you can't capture them, 
make sure they die!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.960
Chiyome, hurry and get them free!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.380
You have my thanks!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.140
Wow, I thought I was dead for a sec.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.590
Sir Goemon!

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.200
Sir Goemon, are you all right?!

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:52.760
Muscle to metal, Arm Bracer.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.450
<b>Muscle to metal
Arm Bracer</b>

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.510
No problems here.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.640
It seems we've dealt with most of them.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.760
Let's use this chance to free the captives.

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.820
We can rendezvous with Lady Chiyome.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.010
Goemon! Sir Arc!

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.980
Lady Chiyome! Lady Ariane!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.110
Everything went smoothly on this end.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.940
And the beastpeople?

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:22.540
They're gathered in the hall.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.060
You were able to free them all?

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:27.380
Everyone who was here.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:30.700
That just leaves
the building in the back.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.450
Reinforcements should be 
arriving from the castle soon.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.440
We must make haste!

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:35.200
Right!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.880
I'll stay here. Go with Chiyome.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.340
You would stay alone?

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:43.940
Take care of our people.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.760
Sir Goemon...

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.190
Indeed, consider it done!

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:23.840
Body to water, Liquid Wolf Fang!

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.170
We're saved...

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.300
We can go home!

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:09.960
What is this smell?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:33.420
The injured and the sick 
couldn't be sold, so they...

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:46.620
Forgive me...

00:08:55.560 --> 00:09:00.100
Lady Chiyome, we should 
get everyone to safety.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.480
Yes, please.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.400
Muscle to metal: Arm Bracer.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:17.170
Muscle to metal, Arm Bracer!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.160
<b>Muscle to metal
Arm Bracer</b>

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.790
Get him!

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:26.740
That's everyone!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.970
The reinforcements are already here?

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:32.020
Let's be quick.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.480
That was the last group.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.730
The other slave markets seem 
to have been liberated safely.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.400
Arc, are you going?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:01.740
Yes.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.630
I leave these people in your care...

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.210
while I put an end to this.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:10.720
Damn it! What is with this beastperson?!

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.380
How is he not dead?!

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.720
Sir Goemon. You did well to hold out.

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.060
Sir Arc!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.620
The others are free.

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:28.650
Another one's appeared from nowhere!

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:30.990
Doesn't matter! Kill him, too!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.260
Do you mind if I join you for the last round?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.490
By all means.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:37.840
Let us completely wipe this 
disgusting institution away!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.530
<b>Rock Fang</b>

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.530
<b>Rock Fang</b>

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.390
Rock Fang!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:49.460
<b>Muscle to stone 
Rock Spear Strike</b>

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:49.500
Muscle to stone, Rock Spear Strike!

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:57.970
They're putting on quite the show...

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.740
Will Sir Arc be all right?

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:03.920
As long as they're not fighting 
a Dragon Lord, he should be.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.600
Lady Ariane... please.

00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:24.220
Flame...

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:05.030
I swear, I will become stronger...

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:10.810
so that no one else will 
ever suffer like you have.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:19.000
Episode 9

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:19.000
The Capital in Chaos and a Maiden's Oath

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.070
What's become of Etzat?

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:26.420
Why haven't I received a report?!

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:30.520
There seems to be confusion 
among the royal army.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:33.480
Enough! I'll go and see for myself.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:38.440
You needn't concern yourself, Prince Dakares.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.910
What are you—

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:53.540
Cetrion... why?

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.040
I appreciate your efforts, Cetrion.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.180
Your praise humbles me,

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:06.900
Prince Sekt.

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:09.680
Your arrangements in this matter 
have been without fail.

00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:14.680
We had word of beastpeople having 
infiltrated the castle town.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.140
I thought whatever action they took 
would make an ideal opportunity...

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.220
Yes.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:20.990
The timing couldn't have been better.

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:23.860
The Yuriarna situation is 
unfolding as expected, as well.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:27.950
Despite the loss of the wolves and 
men to this mysterious knight...

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:33.410
One of the men who escaped did so with 
some of Princess Yuriarna's belongings.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:38.580
Excellent work.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:42.590
Let's announce that Yuriarna was killed 
in a scheme arranged by Dakares.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.360
Yes, sir.

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:49.260
It's such a shame, Dakares.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:55.730
You were obedient to the Holy Revlon Empire 
in the east, and this is your reward.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:02.700
Now the throne of the Rhoden Kingdom is mine.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.650
Sir Arc! Lady Ariane!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:10.590
And the others?

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.120
Safe and on their way.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.240
I see. That's a relief.

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:17.330
Looks like the mission's a success.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.800
Yes...

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:25.970
What's the matter, Sir Goemon?

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.390
Impressive...!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.410
My friend! The great hero!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.190
You truly live up to the name of Goemon!

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:57.620
What splendid fighting!

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:00.520
There they go again...

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.130
Magnificent!

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.630
They must have something 
fundamental in common.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.630
My friend!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:10.430
We can't let them outshine us, 
though, can we Chiyome?

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:11.730
Right.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.140
I'm going to get stronger.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:18.720
Much stronger, so that I can save many more.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:28.700
Behold, Sir Goemon! The dawning 
sun blesses our camaraderie!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.700
My friend!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.510
Allow me to once again offer 
my gratitude for your help.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:48.000
Don't worry about it.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:51.060
Indeed, the help was offered freely.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:53.720
But where will you go now?

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:58.930
We'll head to a hidden village deep within 
in the Calcut Mountains.

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.410
I see...

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.730
More importantly...

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:05.240
I need to provide the 
information I promised you.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:13.150
m 0 0 l 190 0 l 190 30 l 0 30

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:13.150
The Grand Duchy of Limbult

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:13.150
The Grand Duchy of Limbult

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.960
We've got great prices!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:37.900
Sister!

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:47.110
I'm so glad you're safe, Yuriarna!

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:55.210
It's such a relief that you're alive...

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:59.160
I apologize for the belated arrival, Sister.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:05.160
When I heard you had been slain by 
Dakares, my heart nearly stopped.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.460
Slain by Brother Dakares?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.080
Sister, what do you mean?

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:19.680
There was apparently some trouble in Olav.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:24.150
Dakares was behind it all, 
and he was slain by General Cetrion.

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:28.200
Then Prince Dakares... is dead?

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:34.160
<i>Which means Brother Sekt is 
now heir to the throne...</i>

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:38.360
But how does that imply Brother 
Dakares was the one who attacked me?

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:40.220
When Dakares was killed,

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:46.220
he had the necklace you received from 
Mother, the one that you always wear.

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:49.720
The same necklace that went missing...

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:55.400
<i>I was attacked, and then 
Brother Dakares died?</i>

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:59.660
<i>Could Brother Sekt have arranged for it all?</i>

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:05.020
<i>I'm not even sure the attack 
was Brother Dakares' idea, now.</i>

00:18:05.240 --> 00:18:08.560
All that really matters is that you're alive.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.900
We should let Father know immediately.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:12.430
No, Sister.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:16.400
For a time, let's keep 
my survival to ourselves.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.420
I'm certain it will prove useful.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:22.330
With his path to ascendancy cleared,

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:27.790
my cautious brother will be 
in no hurry to take the throne.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:33.560
This will give me the time 
I need to carry out my duty.

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:37.090
I must speak with the elves.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.720
Sister, I ask for your help.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.670
For the sake of both human and elf races.

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.960
Have you informed them of our situation?

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:56.740
Yes, it ended up turning into a 
bigger deal than I imagined,

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:59.740
so I thought that Danka should know.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.960
Shall we be on our way, then?

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:11.800
This is the information I promised you.

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.970
The people listed on the trafficking contract...

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.720
They took the enslaved elves

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:25.720
to the Holy Revlon Empire in the east.

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:32.960
The Holy Revlon Empire...

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.410
<i>The Holy Revlon Empire.</i>

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:45.790
<i>What kind of nation is it?</i>

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.370
<i>Since hearing the name,</i>

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:51.490
<i>Lady Ariane's occasionally had 
a very serious look on her face.</i>

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:55.990
<i>And this has become an international trip...</i>

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:59.050
<i>When all I wanted to do 
is help out where I could.</i>

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.630
Let's hurry, Arc.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:06.140
We set out for the Holy Empire of Revlon!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:12.480
<i>What might be awaiting us in that land?</i>

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.620
m 0 0 l 248 0 l 248 30 l 0 30

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.620
Holy Revlon Empire, Imperial Capital

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.520
I have news from the spies in Rhoden.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:39.680
Prince Dakares has been 
slain by Prince Sekt...

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:42.330
Emperor Domitianus.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:45.300
Emperor
Domitianus Revlon Valtiafelbe

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.300
Dakares is dead?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:48.320
After I provided him with rings?

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.020
What has become of Yuriarna's 
assassination, then?

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.990
The princess is dead.

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.860
That went as planned, then.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.870
No, sir.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:01.760
At the time of the operation, 
the rings had been destroyed,

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.740
and the wolves ended up being useless.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:08.530
It's believed the princess was 
killed by a different assailant...

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.210
Sekt, most likely.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:16.920
Killing Yuriarna so that he could 
claim it was Dakares' doing.

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.470
It would seem so.

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:23.420
It seems the heir to the throne 
of Rhoden might be a handful.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.930
And what of Fumba?

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:31.140
His plan to bring the nation to 
ruin is progressing smoothly.

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:37.350
I suppose I'll look forward 
to seeing what he has planned.

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
Next Time

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
Hope for the Future Found in the Desert

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
